    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. On the left side of the scene, there is a pan. A book is located above the pan, and a watch is located above the book; these three objects are aligned vertically. Additionally, for every mouse in the image, it is placed to the right of the watch, and a donut is placed to the right of that mouse.",
